	('Eddy frowned','Eddy cau mày','00:00:20.270','00:00:22.190','little-cat-tire-town-school-3'),
	('"I\'m slow," he said. "I just wish I was fast"','Cậu nói: "Mình chạy chậm lắm. Mình chỉ ước mình chạy nhanh hơn thôi"','00:00:29.170','00:00:34.210','little-cat-tire-town-school-3'),
	('"I bet you\'re fast," said Dipper. "Let\'s all race!"','Dipper nói: "Mình tin là cậu chạy nhanh đấy! Chúng ta cùng đua nhé!"','00:00:35.570','00:00:40.230','little-cat-tire-town-school-3'),
