	('Yay! said Poppy','Poppy reo lên: "Hoan hô!"','00:00:53.070','00:00:55.430','little-cat-tire-town-school-3'),
	('"This will be fun," said Jeb','Jeb nói: "Chắc chắn sẽ vui lắm đây"','00:00:56.370','00:00:59.030','little-cat-tire-town-school-3'),
	('Everyone lined up','Mọi người xếp thành hàng ngang','00:01:08.600','00:01:10.700','little-cat-tire-town-school-3'),
	('Poppy looked at everyone','Poppy nhìn mọi người','00:01:12.840','00:01:15.000','little-cat-tire-town-school-3'),
	('Ready, set, honk, honk!','Sẵn sàng, chuẩn bị, bíp bíp!','00:01:16.100','00:01:20.280','little-cat-tire-town-school-3'),
	('Eddy took off','Eddy lao vút về phía trước','00:01:21.840','00:01:23.160','little-cat-tire-town-school-3'),
	('Dipper played music','Dipper bật nhạc','00:01:28.790','00:01:30.470','little-cat-tire-town-school-3'),
	('Jeb rolled slowly','Jeb từ từ lăn bánh','00:01:35.310','00:01:37.170','little-cat-tire-town-school-3'),
	('Poppy drove through a puddle','Poppy lái xe lao qua một vũng nước','00:01:49.540','00:01:51.440','little-cat-tire-town-school-3'),
	('"Woohoo!" cried Poppy','Poppy reo lên thích thú: "Gù hú!"','00:01:52.060','00:01:54.160','little-cat-tire-town-school-3'),
	('She drove through the puddle again','Cô ấy lại lái xe lao qua vũng nước một lần nữa','00:01:54.800','00:01:56.760','little-cat-tire-town-school-3'),
